  "description": "All YITAMOTOR products have one thing in common – they offer the best possible performance and dependability.\nYou get a great upgraded towing mirror that meets the same standards set for factory mirrors and they mount in the same location for easy installation.\nWith strict quality control standards, the replacement mirrors are steady and have no vibration even at highway speeds when driving.\nProvide a better and wider angle of rear view, which improves visibility and reduces blind spots to ensure the safety of drivers and passengers.\nEnhance the Style of the Vehicle and make your vehicle stand out on the road.\nFitment\n2002-2008 Dodge RAM 1500\n2003-2009 Dodge RAM 2500 3500\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nFitment: compatible with 2002 2003 2004 2005 2006 2007 2008 Dodge RAM 1500, 2003 2004 2005 2006 2007 2008 2009 Dodge RAM 2500 3500 (NOT fit 2002 Dodge Ram 2500/3500 and 2009 Dodge Ram 1500)\nPackage contents & dimensions: a pair of flipping trailer tow mirrors, including driver side and passenger side; side mirror length is 19.3”; side mirror size is 10.9”×7.87”\nFunctions: featuring power adjustable & power heated plane mirror, manually adjustable convex lens, manual flipping & manual folding, helping you keep a watchful eye on your surroundings\nEasy to install: just simply connect the plugs of the trailer towing mirror to the corresponding power cord, no drilling or modifications required（professional installation would be highly recommended）\nNote: please check if your vehicle has the same functions as that of towing mirrors, such as turn signal, otherwise some functions of towing mirrors will be disabled when the vehicle does not possess the corresponding functions",
